:: Deadwood Forest Outfits Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-forest-outfits-init'>>
  <<set setup.specialClothesSets.forest_tunic to {
    get text() { return lanSwitch('forest outfit', '森林套装'); },
    requirements: () => isLoveInterest('Gwylan'),
    get hint() { return lanSwitch('become Gwylan’s lover', '与格威岚成为恋人'); },
    shop: ['forest'], feat: false, icon: 'clothes/forest-tunic.png'
  }>>
  <<set setup.specialClothesSets.christmas_tree to {
    get text() { return lanSwitch('Christmas tree stage costume', '圣诞树戏服'); },
    requirements: () => !!V.englishPlayRobinWatch || (!!V.englishPlayRolePlayed && V.englishPlayRolePlayed !== 'none'),
    get hint() { return lanSwitch('perform in the English play, or watch Robin perform', '参加英语剧，或观看罗宾的演出'); },
    shop: ['forest'], feat: false, icon: 'clothes/christmas-tree-costume.png'
  }>>
  <<for _forestOutfitEntry range [
    { name: 'forest tunic', sets: ['forest_tunic'] },
    { name: 'forest skirt', sets: ['forest_tunic'] },
    { name: 'christmas tree costume', sets: ['christmas_tree'] },
    { name: 'christmas tree costume skirt', sets: ['christmas_tree'] }
  ]>>
    <<if !setup.specialClothes.some(item => item.name === _forestOutfitEntry.name)>>
      <<run setup.specialClothes.push(_forestOutfitEntry)>>
    <</if>>
  <</for>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-forest-outfits-state'>>
  <!-- 向旧存档补入原版解锁记录，不覆盖已解锁、成就解锁或作弊解锁的等级。 -->
  <<if Array.isArray($specialClothes)>>
    <<for _forestOutfitName range ['forest tunic', 'forest skirt', 'christmas tree costume', 'christmas tree costume skirt']>>
      <<if !$specialClothes.some(item => item.name === _forestOutfitName)>>
        <<run $specialClothes.push({ name: _forestOutfitName, unlocked: 0 })>>
      <</if>>
    <</for>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Gwylan Talk Clothes Forest Tunic
<<effects>><<run statusCheck('Gwylan')>>
<<if !$gwylanTalked.includes('forest_tunic')>>
  <<set $daily.gwylan.clothesTalk++>><<run $gwylanTalked.pushUnique('forest_tunic')>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You ask Gwylan about the forest outfit. <<He>> looks from the clothes to you, and a smile slowly spreads across <<his>> face.<br><br>
    <<if $worn.upper.name is 'forest tunic'>>
      <<if isLoveInterest('Gwylan')>>"Wearing it already, dear? It suits you."<<else>>"Wearing it already? A good fit."<</if>>
      <<He>> glances at the pouches on your belt. "Keep those fastened in the woods. You don't want to lose anything."
    <<elseif isLoveInterest('Gwylan')>>
      "You want to dress like me, dear? I think it would suit you." <<He>> smooths a fold in the green cloth. "You'll have to let me see it on you."
    <<else>>
      "Want to try it?" <<He>> smooths a fold in the green cloth. "The belt keeps it out of the way when you're walking through the woods. Let me know if you need help with the fit."
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你问起那套森林套装。格威岚看了看衣服，又看向你，嘴角慢慢扬起。<br><br>
    <<if $worn.upper.name is 'forest tunic'>>
      <<if isLoveInterest('Gwylan')>>“已经穿上了，亲爱的？很适合你。”<<else>>“已经穿上了？很合身。”<</if>>
      <<He>>瞥了眼你腰带上的小袋。“进林子记得扣好，免得把东西丢在路上。”
    <<elseif isLoveInterest('Gwylan')>>
      “想和我穿得一样，亲爱的？我想，你穿上一定很好看。”<<He>>抚平绿布上的一道褶皱。“穿好之后，记得来让我看看。”
    <<else>>
      “想试试？”<<He>>抚平绿布上的一道褶皱。“系好腰带，在林子里走动就不碍事了。拿不准合不合身，可以让我看看。”
    <</if>>
<</language>><br><br>
<<gwylanOptions>>

:: Gwylan Talk Clothes Christmas Tree
<<effects>><<run statusCheck('Gwylan')>>
<<if !$gwylanTalked.includes('christmas_tree')>>
  <<set $daily.gwylan.clothesTalk++>><<run $gwylanTalked.pushUnique('christmas_tree')>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You describe the Christmas tree costume from the English play. Gwylan parts the layered green cloth to show you the lining beneath.<br><br>
    "Cloth branches. Much kinder to the wearer than real ones." <<He>> straightens a ribbon. "Let it hang before the performance, and don't shut the baubles in a drawer."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你说起英语剧里的圣诞树戏服。格威岚拨开层层绿布，让你看看下面的内衬。<br><br>
    “布做的树枝，可比真树枝穿着舒服。”<<He>>理顺一截彩带。“演出前挂一阵，别把彩球夹进抽屉里。”
<</language>><br><br>
<<gwylanOptions>>
